  "description": "Foundgine.Providers contains the concrete provider and integration implementations for Foundgine 3.x, including storage providers and adapters, AI/model and MCP tooling integrations, EventStore, gateway integrations, Elasticsearch and vector-store support, and the Entity Framework Core execution provider. The package includes Foundgine-owned ORM and EF Core assemblies plus the AOT and ORM source generators as build-time analyzers. EF Core and other third-party libraries are restored as NuGet dependencies and are not bundled as DLLs. Secure GraphQL/Hot Chocolate execution lives in Foundgine.Extensions alongside GraphQL translation. Consumers supply the semantic model and runtime configuration required by Foundgine.",
